<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 603.12, up 2.33.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.04.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 291 to 239.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,270,590 compared with 18,053,700 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
